### 카카오 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "accessToken": "replace-with-kakao-access-token"
}

### 그룹 공유 링크 발급
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/1/share-link
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-nook-access-token

### 그룹 공유 링크 해제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/1/share-link
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-nook-access-token
